      <h1 style="max-width:680px">We work with trades who show up, do quality work, and hit their dates.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--gray2);max-width:580px;margin-top:20px">VNG runs commercial interior renovation projects across the GTA — offices, medical clinics, restaurants, retail, and industrial. We work with a consistent pool of quality subcontractors and we are always looking to add reliable trades to our network.</p>
