<!-- HOW WE WORK WITH SUBTRADES -->
<section class="cx-section cx-spotlight" id="trades-how" style="background:var(--dark2)">
  <div class="cx-container">
    <div class="r" style="max-width:720px">
      <div class="cx-eyebrow">How We Work</div>
      <h2 class="cx-h2">Straight talk, clear scopes,<br>and invoices paid on time.</h2>
      <p class="cx-sub" style="margin-top:16px">VNG runs clean projects. Scopes are written out and agreed before your crew mobilizes. Change orders are priced and signed before extra work starts. We pay on the schedule we commit to. We do not make subtrades chase invoices.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cx-why-grid stagger" style="margin-top:52px">
      <div class="cx-why-item r">
        <div class="cx-why-num">01</div>
        <h3>Written scopes before every mobilization</h3>
        <p>You know exactly what you are being hired to do before your crew sets foot on site. No verbal agreements, no scope creep without a written change order.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-why-item r">
        <div class="cx-why-num">02</div>
        <h3>Site is ready when you arrive</h3>
        <p>We sequence the schedule so your trade does not arrive to a space that is not ready. Your time on site is productive from day one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-why-item r">
        <div class="cx-why-num">03</div>
        <h3>Invoices paid on the agreed schedule</h3>
        <p>We pay to the payment schedule in the subcontract. No excuses, no delays on signed off work. Subtrades who perform get paid first and get called again.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-why-item r">
        <div class="cx-why-num">04</div>
        <h3>Clear feedback and consistent communication</h3>
        <p>If work is not up to standard, we tell you directly and we work it out. You will not hear about quality issues on the next project — you will hear about them in real time, on this one.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

